.git
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.log
node_modules/
dist/
docs/
adai-digital-arts-report-research/
.claude/

# seed/_build/ is the offline Python pipeline (venv, fetchers, intermediate
# JSON, image cache). ~483 MB — definitely NOT shipping to the Docker
# context. The seed/*.json + seed/embeddings.{bin,json,umap2d.json} files
# that the builder actually needs sit at the top level of seed/.
seed/_build/
# Exception: the UMAP projector runs inside the runtime image (the daily
# cron re-projects the live /data/adai.db). It's a few KB of Python and
# uses the /opt/umap-venv installed in the Dockerfile.
!seed/_build/project_umap.py

# Local-only databases and caches that occasionally land in seed/.
seed/*.bak
seed/*.pre-enrichment.bak
